playstyle = "Retribution: hurts whoever hurts her.
Spines, blows struck back when struck, and damage growing with the damage taken this fight (a grudge). Suggested cards: Riposte's kin, a Grudge status adding to every hit for each hit taken, a Taunt that draws every enemy's attack to her (in co-op, keeping the partner safe)."
